- Don’t run body-parser/validator middleware on that route before verification.

This is also what the current Hono example recommends: Hono uses `context.req.text()` for the raw body and Stripe’s `constructEventAsync`. Stripe’s own docs also stress that signature verification requires the unmodified raw body.

