A correct `useEffect` cleanup should usually do all of these:

```tsx
useEffect(() => {
  const ws = new WebSocket(url)

  const intervalId = window.setInterval(() => {
    // heartbeat / polling / reconnect check
  }, 1000)

  ws.onmessage = (event) => {
    // handle message
  }

  return () => {
    clearInterval(intervalId)

    ws.onmessage = null
    ws.onerror = null
    ws.onopen = null
    ws.onclose = null

    ws.close()
  }
}, [url])
```

