```bash
pnpm why better-auth
```

If you see multiple versions, align them and reinstall. The key fix, though: don’t call `auth.api.acceptInvitation` from a detached server action/route without `headers: await headers()`. Better Auth’s own docs note that the server endpoint requires session cookies.

