await auth.api.acceptInvitation({
  body: {
    invitationId,
  },
  headers: await headers(),
});
```

Or call it from the client with the organization client plugin:

```ts
await authClient.organization.acceptInvitation({
  invitationId,
});
```

Also verify both plugin sides are installed:

```ts
// server
