This is usually one of three production-build-only monorepo issues:

1. The consuming package is missing an explicit dependency:
   ```json
   {
     "dependencies": {
       "@your-scope/pkg": "workspace:*"
     }
   }
   ```
   Dev mode can “work” through TS path aliases, hoisting, or bundler dev resolution, while the production build uses stricter Node/package resolution.

2. The workspace package’s `package.json` exports point to files that do not exist at build time:
   ```json
   {
     "main": "./dist/index.js",
     "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
     "exports": {
       ".": {
         "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
         "import": "./dist/index.js"
       }
     }
   }
   ```
