3. Turbo is not building packages in dependency order. Make sure package build tasks depend on upstream builds:
   ```json
   {
     "tasks": {
       "build": {
         "dependsOn": ["^build"],
         "outputs": ["dist/**", ".next/**", "build/**"]
       }
     }
   }
   ```

