  "dependencies": {
    "@acme/foo": "workspace:*"
  }
}
```

Dev may work through hoisting or TS paths even when this is missing. Production build/runtime often will not.

3. In `turbo.json`, ensure build ordering is explicit:

```json
{
  "tasks": {
    "build": {
      "dependsOn": ["^build"],
      "outputs": ["dist/**", ".next/**", "build/**"]
    }
  }
}
```

4. If you use TypeScript path aliases like this:

```json
{
